  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "33",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 33"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "33",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maeni woth mi nyithindho mir Israel, kinde ma giai i ng’om Misiri ku bang’ udul migi ku bang’ udul migi the cing’ Musa giku Harun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Musa goro ai migi calku woth migi ni kum lembang’ola pa Yehova: man maeni woth migi calku ai migi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Rameses i dwi ma kwong’ane, i ceng’ apar wi abije mi dwi ma kwong’ane; urwone yo ng’ei kadhukuwijo nyithindho mir Israel uai ku cing’ ma tek i wang’ Jumisiri ceke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kinde ma Jumisiri beyiko kayu migi ceke, ma Yehova goyo i kindgi: Yehova poko lembe wi mungu migi bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E nyithindho mir Israel uwotho ugambre Rameses, man gigonjo Sukoth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Sukoth, man gigonjo Etham, ma ni dhu langa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giwotho ugambre Etham, man gilokri cen ba Pihahiroth, ma ni i wang’ Bal-zefon: e gigonjo i wang’ Migdol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre i wang’ Hahiroth, e gikadhu kud i die nam i langa: man gimondo woth mi ceng’ adek i langa mir Etham, e gigonjo i Mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Mara, man gibino Elim: man kulo mi pi apar wi ario ni i Elim, ku thith pier abiro; e gigonjo keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giwotho ugambre Elim, man gigonjo ba Nam Makwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Nam Makwar, man gigonjo i langa mi Sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giwotho ugambre i langa mi Sin, e gigonjo i Dofka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Dofka, man gigonjo i Aluc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Aluc, man gigonjo i Refidim, ka ma pi mbe i ie ma dhanu madhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Refidim, man gigonjo i langa mi Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre i langa mi Sinai, man gigonjo i Kibroth-hatava. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Kibroth-hatava, man gigonjo i Hazeroth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Hazeroth, man gigonjo i Rithma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Rithma, man gigonjo i Rimon-perez. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Rimon-perez, man gigonjo i Libna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Libna, man gigonjo i Risa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Risa, man gigonjo Kehelatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Kehelatha, man gigonjo wi got Cefer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre wi got Cefer, man gigonjo i Harada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Harada, man gigonjo i Makheloth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Makheloth, man gigonjo Tahath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giwotho ugambre Tahath, e gigonjo i Tera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man giwotho ugambre Tera, e gigonjo i Mithka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre i Mithka, man gigonjo i Hacmona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre i Hacmona, man gigonjo i Moseroth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Moseroth, man gigonjo i Bene-yakan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Bene-yakan, man gigonjo i Horhagigad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Horhagigad, man gigonjo i Yothbatha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre i Yothbatha, man gigonjo i Abrona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Abrona, man gigonjo i Ezion-geber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Ezion-geber, man gigonjo i langa mi Zin (ma en e Kadec). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giwotho ugambre Kadec, man gigonjo wi got Hor, i dhu ng’om mir Edom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:37"
          },
