                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Harun ma jalam uidho malu wi got Hor ni kum lembang’ola pa Yehova, e etho kuca, i rundi pier ang’wende yo ng’ei ai ma nyithindho mir Israel uai ko kud i Misiri, i dwi mir abije, i ceng’ ma kwong’ane mi dwije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nwang’u rundi pa Harun dak acel ku pier ario wi adek kinde m’etho wi got Hor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
